  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.06,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Five months on dating apps. All the stupid stuff I did.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_002.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.922,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "And I'm just standing there. Bro. Who was that guy?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_003.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.257,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "It's a game. Chase or get chased. That's it.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_004.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 1.956,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "You chase someone who doesn't want you. Someone chases you, and you don't want them.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_005.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.832,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "And everybody's trying to prove something. Prove what? Nobody knows.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_006.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.522,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "\"Hey, I'm worth looking at.\" Just [BLEEP] off. I don't even care if you exist.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_007.wav",
  "bleeps": [
   [
    1.5757,
    0.32
   ]
  ],
  "duration": 3.434,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "That should've been my mentality. Was it? No. Stupid idiot.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_008.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.852,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "I didn't even want that person.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_009.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 1.439,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "One minute. That's all it would've taken. One minute of using my brain.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_010.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.651,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "But they pull away, and suddenly I'm the one trying. Did I do something? Can I prove I'm better? Am I good enough?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_011.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 5.781,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Good enough for what? I didn't even like you.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_012.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 1.86,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "It's not them you want. It's the attention. You want to be wanted.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_013.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.138,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "They act high value, so you assume they are. They might not be.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_014.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.874,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "And the more desperate you get, the further they go. Like a cat. Chase the cat, the cat leaves.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_015.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.636,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "It's Gojo's Infinity, and daddy Mahoraga isn't on your side. You get closer and closer, and you never get there.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_016.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 6.365,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "The funny part? I saw it happening. In the moment. I looked at it, said \"interesting,\" and kept going.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_017.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.951,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "It's like a drug.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_018.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 0.861,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Meanwhile, my actual life is sitting there like, hello?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_019.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.471,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "I was obsessed with training. Obsessed. One word in my head. Perfection.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_020.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.637,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "I had goals so big I couldn't say them out loud.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_021.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.192,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "What happened to them? Forgot them. Completely. For a situation on my phone.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_022.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.972,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Now I'm training sad, thinking about one person, while making another person sad.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_023.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.397,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "How do you even manage that?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_024.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 1.17,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "So how did I fix it? Genius over here jumped into a new situationship.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_025.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.114,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Beautiful. Amazing. Stupid. Everyone could see it except me.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_026.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.264,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Then I got my wake-up call.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_027.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 1.213,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "I'd been chased before. Everybody has. But not like this.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_028.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.925,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "We'd known each other less than a week, and I was already her whole life.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_029.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.331,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "I don't answer for twenty minutes. I open my phone. Twenty messages.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_030.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.361,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Do you wanna go? Do you still wanna talk to me? Do I even matter to you?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_031.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.559,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "It's been a week. I just walked into your life, and it already revolves around me?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_032.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.825,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "And then it hit me. Wait. Do I act like this?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_033.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.102,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Not that bad. Maybe five percent. But even one percent, I'm not accepting that from myself.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
