  "file": "line_037.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.197,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "And these apps? Use your head. They don't want you to leave. They want your money. You stay stuck, they stay happy.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_038.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 5.029,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "So leave. And don't tell me you're \"resisting.\"",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_039.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.02,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "If a knife is cutting you, you don't resist the knife. You stay away from it. You let it heal.",
