  "file": "line_045.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.941,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "Remember being a kid? Everything was bright. You enjoyed everything. That's your natural state.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_046.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.675,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "You can go back. Give it a month. Maybe two.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_047.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 2.05,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "\"My life is ruined.\" Relax. Remember that high school relationship? You thought it was forever.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_048.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 4.887,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "You survived. Maybe you're in high school right now. I'm not. Or am I?",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": true,
  "file": "line_049.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 3.094,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "You can be reborn. For real. People change their whole lives. You're not stuck being the same person forever.",
  "exaggeration": 0.5,
  "break_after": false,
  "file": "line_050.wav",
  "bleeps": [],
  "duration": 5.535,
  "voice": "am_puck",
  "speed": 1.0
 },
 {
  "text": "You're human. Humans make mistakes. It wouldn't be fair if you only got one shot.",
